  m_text: 'Both columns insert the same block, carrying the same animator, and remove
    one when it is clicked. Left plays the animator itself: the block slides in or
    out, the others snap. Right does the same inside StartViewTransition: the others
    glide, and the gap closes as the block leaves. The transition animates the difference;
    the animator only styles the block.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
