  m_text: Every feature at once, authored the way a game is. Each card is an unnamed
    container holding a persisting Background and a named Body with the parts; the
    page is a prefab spawned inside the transition and destroyed on the way back.
    The surface itself grows into the page, the bodies cross-fade over it, the avatar
    and title fly to the header, and the spinner is the same object throughout.
